nt state changes are not part of the authorization conclusion; source discovery remains not-tested and no repository-wide completeness claim is made.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"CreateMemoShare is the assessed handler and begins by resolving the current user before processing the share request.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":23,"endLine":32}]},{"id":"f-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler requires a non-nil current user, matching the supplied authenticated-caller premise.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":25,"endLine":32}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler extracts the memo identifier from the request parent, loads that memo, rejects a missing memo, and requires normal row status.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":37,"endLine":50}]},{"id":"f-authorization","kind":"control","statement":"The handler denies unless access.CanManageMemo permits the caller to manage the selected memo, and separately denies SPACE-audience memos.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":51,"endLine":56}]},{"id":"f-admin-helper","kind":"control","statement":"CanManageMemo delegates to ownsOrAdministers; an active user passes when the user is the creator or has the instance ADMIN role, so authorship is not required for an active administrator.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":61,"endLine":85}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the authorization and audience checks, the handler constructs a share write carrying the memo ID, caller ID, and write policy, then calls Store.CreateMemoShare.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":66,"endLine":80}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler rejects SPACE-audience memos before the share store effect; the supplied memo premise is non-SPACE.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8